ation Committee has.==W== The majority of Novians won't believe a word they say.",0,""],["w",0.3],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_150","a","008",null,null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",1.0],["se","se_208"],["say","avg1_150","The real question is whether Angie will catch that slip-up in the footage.",0,""],["ctl","avg3_152","a","003","happy",null,null,null,null,"tiao2","Linear",1.0],["say","avg3_152","We are safe on that front. Angie doesn't have time to analyze these videos, and I am obviously not telling her.==W== For the next two weeks, let her chase a fake Tyrant in Philae.",0,""],["w",0.3],["goon"],["ctl","avg3_152","a","007","music",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg3_152","Lady Albedo is stationed there, so the Committee has no chance of breaking through with their current numbers.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_150","a","009",null,null,0.0,null,null,null,"OutBack",0.7],["se","se_226"],["se","se_074"],["say","avg1_150","Shh,==W== someone's coming.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_152","a","017",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_150","a","002",null,0.3,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["ctl","avg3_152","a","010",null,0.5,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["se","se_443"],["show","avg2_947","a","002",0.77,null,null,0,null,0.0],["w",0.3],["se","se_062"],["ctl","avg2_947","a",null,null,0.75,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_947","a","007","attention",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","Serious Committee Member","Bastelina, Lady Angie has new orders... Laru, you're here as well. Then listen up, both of you.",0,""],["ctl","avg2_947","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",1.0],["se","se_208"],["say","Serious Committee Member","All Committee members are to immediately destroy any non-portable documents and supplies. Evacuate Emor by 12:00 today.==W== Proceed independently to your assigned cities according to the provided maps.