_100","How late did the girls stay up? Iris is usually up by now.",2,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_024_stop"],["se","se_169"],["bgm","m58"],["trn",0,1,false,false,0.3],["w",0.3],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["clear",1,0,0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",0,2],["film",0],["w",0.2],["bg","mood_1",0,0.0],["stg",0,null,null,1.0,"OutSine",1.5,null,null,null],["show","avg1_103","c","004",0.45,-0.2,null,0,null,null],["show","avg1_111","a","012",0.32,null,null,0,null,null],["show","avg1_139","b","026",0.52,null,null,0,null,null],["show","avg1_112","a","012",0.75,null,null,0,null,null],["ctl","avg1_112","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.0],["ctl","avg1_103","c",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.0],["ctl","avg1_112","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhanLP","Linear",1.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_bubble_lp",0,0],["trn",1,1,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["say","0","Last night, Allie and the New Star Guild talked for hours. Between her story and Firenze's, we finally uncovered the truth behind the orphanage's disappearance.==P== United Harvest did investigate the orphanage, and Allie did notice she was being watched.==P== But there's one thing that even Firenze didn't know about: It wasn't just United Harvest. At least three or four factions were sniffing around back then.==P== All of them were after the \"treasure\" hidden in the orphanage basement.",10,""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,1,false,false,0.3],["w",0.5],["fx",0,"fx_avg_bubble_lp",1,0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",1,2],["clear",1,0,0],["stage",3,0,0],["stage",4,0,0],["bg","luckyoasis_forest_daylight",3,0.0],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.0],["bg","city_alley_night",4,0.0],["w",0.5],["show","avg1_110","c","012",0.65,null,1.25,4,null,null],["show","avg3_1249","a","002",0.32,null,-1.25,4,null,null],["show","avg1_103","a","002",0.52,null,1.4,0,null,null],["trn",1,1,false,false,0.5],["say","0","Calling it treasure is a stretch. The basement was essentially packed with random junk. Both the steering wheel and the engine powering the Lucky Oasis were dug out of there, for instance.==P== ==W==Amber's outfit that looks suspiciously like a White Cat uniform and her rare magical guns came from the basement, too.==P== ==W==Firenze showed up late but still managed to scrounge up a magical compass and a Tawny Nightingale recipe book.==P== ==W==But Allie couldn't care less about the treasure those companies were drooling over. She had no idea where any of it came from. As long as the kids were safe, all that junk meant nothing to her.",10,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["goon"],["goon"],["w",0.5],["trn",0,1,false,false,0.3],["w",0.3],["clear",1,0,0],["stage",3,1,1],["stage",4,1,1],["w",0.2],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",0,2],["bg","sky_rain",0,0.0],["se","se_193"],["stg",0,null,null,1.03,"OutSine",2.0,null,null,null],["show","avg3_168","a","006",0.1,-0.2,-1.3,0,null,0.0],["show","avg1_139","b","028",0.8,-0.2,1.3,0,null,0.0],["trn",1,1,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_168","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.9,null,"OutSine",0.5],["ctl","avg1_139","b",null,null,null,null,null,0.9,null,"OutQuint",0.5],["say","0","So she gathered the kids and left Emor that night without looking back. When I told her how Rainea was doing, a look of pure relief washed over her face.==P== ==W==She didn't even have a destination in mind. She just saw the words \"Edge of the World\" on a map and figured it had to be far enough away. After a long journey, they ended up in Mirage.==P== ==W==Daisy Orphanage, the orphanage's new name, was inspired by the beautiful desert daisies their new home was surrounded by.",10,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_168","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuint",0.3],["hide","avg3_168",0.3],["ctl","avg1_139","b",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuint",0.3],["hide","avg1_139",0.3],["bg","mirage_street_daylight",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["bg","mirage_creche_outside_daylight",0,0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],