anks for having me,==W== uh,==W== ...==W==",1,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","011",null,"lengzhan"],["goon"],["w",0.5],["goon"],["mrt",0,"y","025","shock","lengzhan"],["say","avg3_100","Wait a second. ==W== I should be careful about what I call her.",2,""],["w",0.7],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["choice",["Her name. No titles.","I'm with the New Star Guild. I'll use their title for her.","Mom!"],[[["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","009","think",null],["say","avg3_100","I'm not one of the kids here.==W== Calling her by name is the most honest approach.",2,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["mrt",0,"z","013","happy","diantou"],["say","avg3_100","... Thanks for having me, Allie.==W== Let me help out around the orphanage.==W== I can't just sit here without contributing.",1,""],["w",0.3],["ctl","avg1_139","b","007",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["goon"],["w",0.5],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_226"],["stg",0,null,-30.0,1.15,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_139","b","013",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_139","Allie==W==...==W==",0,""],["w",0.3],["goon"],["w",0.8],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","025","flurry","niunie"],["say","avg3_100","Uh...==W== I thought calling you by name was appropriate.==W== Was that out of line?",1,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"OutQuint",0.7,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_139","b","003","happy",null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_139","Not at all, it's perfect.==W== I appreciate the honesty.==W== Call me Allie.",0,""],["w",0.8],["goon"],["w",0.3],["goon"],["w",0.5]],[["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","009","think",null],["say","avg3_100","Anyway,==W== matching what Noya, Iris, and Amber call her is the safest bet.",2,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["se","se_074"],["mrt",4,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["cbg",0,-50.0,null,null,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_139","b","0