ks for having me, Mom!==W== Since I'm staying at the Daisy Orphanage now,==W== that makes you my Mom.",1,""],["w",1],["mrt",0,"z","011",null,"tiao2"],["se","se_061"],["goon"],["w",0.5],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_139","b","011","shy",null,-1.0,2.8,null,"JuGong","OutQuart",0.8],["cbg",0,null,null,0.98,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["se","se_062"],["say","avg1_139","Oh, what a sweet talker.==W== Such a good kid.==W== If only those three had half your charm.",0,""],["w",0.2],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5,null,null,"Zhong"],["se","se_208"],["w",0.3],["goon"],["w",0.8],["ctl","avg1_139","b",null,null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5,null,null,"JingTouYaoHuang"],["se","se_251"],["goon"],["w",0.5],["se","se_226"],["se","se_227"],["bgm",""],["mrt",1,"z","007",null,"lengzhan"],["say","avg3_100","Urgh...==W== Your grip strength...!==W== I can't breathe...",1,""],["w",1],["mrt",0,"z","007",null,"lengzhan"],["goon"],["w",1],["mrt",0,"z","021",null,"lengzhan"],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["trn",0,1,false,false,0.3],["w",0.8],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,"stop"],["se","se_074"],["cbg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_139","b","010",null,null,0.0,1.0,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["trn",1,1,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["ctl","avg1_139","b",null,"flurry",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_139","Ah, sorry!==W== Are you okay?!",0,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_139","b","003","speechless",null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_139","My kids are at that age where they refuse to call me Mom anymore.==W== Hearing it from someone their age got me a little too excited. Heh heh... ♪",0,""],["w",1.2],["ctl","avg1_139","b","011","vexation",null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",1.0],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","010","sigh",null],["say","avg3_100","Phew, you startled me...==W== Honestly, with my amnesia and everything else that happened,==W== I don't remember my parents. I don't even know where home is.",1,""],["w",0.8],["mrt",0,"y","009",null,"diantou"],["bgm",""],["se","se_077"],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_139","b","007",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["goon"],["mrt",0,"y","020","attention",null],["say","avg3_100","That hug felt a lot like ...==W== motherly love.==W== I didn't mind it at all.",1,""],["w",0.8],["mrt",0,"z","023","happy","JuGong"],["bgm",""],["goon"],["w",0.5],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_139","b","003","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_139","Oh, you poor thing...==W== Well, how about this? Call me by my name around the others. But when it's just us, call me Mom all you want ♪ Don't be shy.",0,""],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_139","b","004","love",null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",1.0],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","011","sigh","niunie1"],["say","avg3_100","Noya and the others are definitely going to be shocked when they find out.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5]]]],["stg",0,null,null,1.0,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["se","se_062"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","022","happy",null],["say","avg3_100","Alright, let's take it from the top.==W== Good morning, Allie.",1,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["mrt",0,"z","015","attention","diantou"],["say","avg3_100","By the way, aren't you exhausted? You went to bed way later than I did.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,-30.0,1.2,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_139","b","011","shy",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_139","A tiny bit. But honestly, only a little. I actually got up at six to make breakfast.==W== Want a bite, ==PLAYER_NAME==?",0,""],["w",0.8],["ctl","avg1_139","b","002",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",1.0],["se","se_077"],["goon"],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"Zhong"],["se","se_070"],["mrt",1,"z","007",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Th-That early?!",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_139","b","003","music",null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_139","Occupational hazard of being the orphanage mom. I'm used to it. You all should settle in and get some proper rest for the next few days.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","010","sigh",null],["say","avg3_100","I appreciate it, but we still have to track down the desert Monolith.==W== It's the only way I can figure out who I am.",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"y","014",null,"diantou"],["se","se_226"],["bgm",""],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_139","b","007","attention",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_139","I know. I heard about your journey last night.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_139","b","006",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",1.0],["se","se_077"],["bgm","m31"],["say","avg1_139","But if you ask me, you're all pushing yourselves too hard.",0,""],["cbg",0,null,null,0.98,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_139","b","013",null,null,-0.2,1.25,null,"JuGong","OutQuart",0.7],["se","se_062"],["say","avg1_139","Look at your dark circles,==W== and Noya was out cold last night. She didn't even toss and turn.",0,""],["w",0.8],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_139","b",null,"speechless",null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_139","Iris said she'd help with breakfast, but she's still asleep.==W== Amber didn't even climb the rafters.==W== She curled up right on the floor.",0,""],["w",0.8],["goon"],["w",0.3],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_139","b","007","attention",null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_139","Besides, you're a friend to my kids.==W== That makes you one of my own.",0,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["se","se_062"],["cbg",0,null,null,1.0,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_139","b","003",null,null,0.0,1.0,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["say","avg1_139","Let me look into this missing Monolith for you.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","015","question",null],["say","avg3_100","Wait, but we searched the desert for days and found nothing. The Desert Scorpions even mentioned a legend about it vanishing from Mirage. How do you plan to investigate?",1,""],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_139","b","002",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",1.0],["se","se_077"],["say","avg1_139","The Sunset Desert is massive. Wandering around blindly will only exhaust you. First thing we need is more eyes out there.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","010","sigh",null],["say","avg3_100","There's barely anyone living here. How are we supposed to round up a search party?==W==",1,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,0.0,1.1,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_139","b","005","love",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_139","Don't let the orphanage mom title fool you. I have connections here in Mirage. Leave the digging to me.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_139","b","004","happy",null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_139","Just focus on recovering. Otherwise, even if we find the Monolith, you won't have the energy to climb it.",0,""],["w",0.5],["film",0],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,-100.0,null,"OutSine",5.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_139","b","005",null,null,-0.03,1.1,0.0,null,"OutQuart",1.0],["hide","avg1_139",1.0],["se","se_062"],["se","se_024"],["w",1.0],["bg","sky_sunny",0,0.5],["say","0","Wrapped in that comforting motherly love, Noya, Iris, Amber, and I got a full night of rest for the first time since I woke up.==P== It felt like someone hit pause on the chaos of our lives.",10,""],["bgm",""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,false,false,2.0],["w",2.0],["se","se_024_stop"],["end"]]}